============================================================
7. REWARD SYSTEM
============================================================
Source: BiggiCollectionRewards.sol + BiggiTokenRewards.sol + BiggiNftRewards.sol

A) CollectionRewards (POL payouts)
- Orange reward: 1000 POL
  Condition: own all 10 backgrounds for the same mainId in Block 1.
- Block reward: 3000 POL
  Condition: own all 10 mainIds in any block 1..9 (each block rewarded once globally).
- Rainbow reward: 10000 POL
  Condition: own all 10 mainIds in Block 10 (global one-time).

B) TokenRewards (weekly BIGGI)
- Each NFT can claim once per week.
- Unit reward = 1 BIGGI per weight unit.
- Block weight by blockIdx:
  1:10 2:20 3:30 4:40 5:50 6:60 7:70 8:80 9:90 10:100

Example payout:
- Own 3 NFTs: block1 + block5 + block10.
- Units = 10 + 50 + 100 = 160 units.
- Weekly payout = 160 BIGGI.

C) NFTRewards
- Character rewards minted when a block completes (last mint in block).
- Manual rewards (owner-defined).
- Mystery rewards use VRF for randomized assignment.

Reward diagram:
- diagrams/reward-system.svg

