============================================================
8. DASHBOARD & TRANSPARENCY
============================================================
Frontend panels (React/Vite):
- Live Stats: ticket price, block prices, mint counts, rewards counters, LP price, etc.
- Tokenomics: flow, distributor, buyback, drip, reserve/LM, policy, DEX.
- VRF Panel: shows redeem status + history.
- Rewards panel: collection rewards, token rewards, NFT rewards.
- User panel: gallery and wallet stats.

Data sources:
- BiggiMainReader: snapshots (ticket price, block prices, mint counts, rewards counters).
- BiggiTokenomikReader: DEX reserves, buyback stats, reserve stats, drip stats.
- Reserve/Treasury readers: reserve balances and treasury stats.
- TokenRewardsReader / NFTRewardsReader for reward status.

IPFS:
- Metadata is fetched through multiple gateways (ipfs.io, cloudflare-ipfs, pinata, dweb, etc.).

