============================================================
11. FAQ (NON-TECHNICAL ANSWERS)
============================================================
Q: Is the mint price fixed?
A: No. Ticket price starts at 0.001 POL and grows +0.33% with each mint.

Q: Can I sell the NFT before redeeming the ticket?
A: The ticket itself is an NFT (ERC721). You can transfer it, but the redeem can only be done by the current owner.

Q: Is the VRF provably fair?
A: Yes. Chainlink VRF provides verifiable randomness and on-chain proof.

Q: Where do rewards come from?
A: Mint proceeds go to CollectionRewards (POL) and TokenRewards (BIGGI) via the Distributor and Treasury.

Q: How is liquidity created?
A: Reserve supplies POL + BIGGI to LiquidityManager, which pairs them and locks LP in LiquidityVault.

Q: What stabilizes price?
A: The buyback system converts POL into BIGGI and the drip loop adds continuous demand and reserve support.

